mode will be inphase.;
#X text 240 178 Maxre optimization is used when audience is confined
to the center of the circle.;
#X text 240 218 Inphase optimization is used when the audience covers
all the circle.;
#X text 240 258 NB: This is theoretical \, the best choice is to trust
your ears.;
